'''Giant PAC-MAN Strikes!''' (強襲！巨大パックマン, ''Kyousyū! Kyodai Pakkuman'', '''Assault! Gigantic Pac-Man''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, rewards and progress made in True Assassin Assault! will reset when the event ends. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Giant PAC-MAN]].

==Overview==
Giant PAC-MAN Strikes! contains a total of 10 stages. After beating 3 stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards and gauntlet progress reset with every appearance of the event.

